     "src": "ENC",
     "node": null,
     "category": "shy",
     "emotion_field": null
    }
   ]
  },
  "chai_zanhoi_smile": {
   "speaker": "chai_zanhoi",
   "expr": "smile",
   "lines": 2,
   "evidence": [
    {
     "text": "台慶爭位，年年都爭，今年特別勁，邊個企前排、邊個壓軸出場，監製開咗幾次會都未定到。",
     "src": "ENC",
     "node": null,
     "category": "happy",
     "emotion_field": null
    },
    {
     "text": "受得起就收下啦。多謝你嗰陣企得正，呢句我欠你好耐喇。",
     "src": "ENC",
     "node": null,
     "category": "happy",
     "emotion_field": null
    }
   ]
  },
  "chai_zanhoi_think": {
   "speaker": "chai_zanhoi",
   "expr": "think",
   "lines": 2,
   "evidence": [
    {
     "text": "留低嘅亦唔一定係忠心，可能係驚去到新台冇位企。邊個會走邊個會留，要睇佢最近接咩戲，唔好睇佢把口。",
     "src": "ENC",
     "node": null,
     "category": "think",
     "emotion_field": null
    },
    {
     "text": "……你講得啱。名呢樣嘢，儲要十年，蝕只要一晚。我再諗清楚，先覆佢哋。",
     "src": "ENC",
     "node": null,
     "category": "think",
     "emotion_field": null
    }
   ]
  },
  "cheung_hakfan_serious": {
   "speaker": "cheung_hakfan",
   "expr": "serious",
   "lines": 2,
   "evidence": [
    {
